  message: "B3 LANDED (PR #1560, merge 37c4ce609d; status unchanged). Migrated erlang, clojure, commonlisp, r, cmake, gnuplot callables to the ADR-0035 producer formula via overload_arity.declared_arity_stable_id (erlang name/arity + meta.arity, macros -define args; clojure ns/name + defmethod dispatch value + merged arity bodies; commonlisp package::name + lambda list + specializers as types + qualifiers as decorators; r params + outer/inner scope chain; cmake/gnuplot arg lists). Floor/null -> producer only: producer ids byte-identical before/after on gate fixtures and a corpus sample. Baseline 37 langs 63 floor / 40 null / 37 deletion failures -> 31 langs 55 floor / 30 null / 32 deletion failures. EVIDENCE on dev 37c4ce609d: delete-an-earlier-sibling via hypergumbo run on each language's gate fixture -> erlang 3/3, clojure 5/5, commonlisp 2/2, r 2/2, cmake 2/2, gnuplot 2/2 survivors same id, 0 null. Corpus sample (~/whole_bunch_of_repos copies) gated floor/null before -> after: erlang 1,470 floor + 2 null -> 0 (59 files), clojure 319 floor + 20 null -> 0 (60), r 472 floor + 25 null -> 0 (80), cmake 19 floor -> 0 (60); gnuplot sample has no functions; no commonlisp corpus files exist. Carry-overs: stale Elixir docstrings in base.py / beam_behaviour.py fixed; producer-axis value_flow false positive filed and fixed as WI-firog. Ledger: scratchpad fixes/tusad/TUSAD_PLAN.md."  # 8ee6
